  "foaf:name": "AI-Enabled Community for Ocean Literacy",
  "sdo:name": "AI-Enabled Community for Ocean Literacy",
  "sdo:description": "AI-ECO pioneers a smart community model in Shenzhen’s Nan’ao, uniting marine conservation and AI. Three pillars: 1) AI drones with nutrient- and CO₂ sensors monitor carbon-sink dynamics in corals, mangroves and wetlands at Shekou/Dapeng Bay, secured by AI-blockchain for traceable carbon data. 2) An integrated “air-sea-land” AI network feeds the Nan’ao Smart Platform, producing visual ecological balance sheets for precise conservation management. 3) An AI app empowers residents and global users via personal contribution tracking, multilingual courses (Cantonese/English/Mandarin) and carbon-sink point exchange, sharing the “Nan’ao AI Solution.” AI-ECO delivers a globally scalable model integrating ecology, tech and community prosperity under UN Ocean Decade #8.2 (Global ONCE).",
